WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.875 --> 00:00:04.000
- What's up, everyone, and

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.166
welcome back to the final week of the B/R

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:10.750
Gridiron Punishment League.
Your champions of it all,

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.875
FlemLo and Jack.

00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:16.666
This week's losers are Amanda and Lou.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.750
Lou, you look upset.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.916
- I'm a little hurt about my team.
You play to win the game.

00:00:20.916 --> 00:00:22.833
You guys won.
Congrats to you guys.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:24.500
- Appreciate it, Lou.
- Who let you down this week

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.750
besides Lou?
- Actually, Lou came in third place.

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.250
- No, you didn't.

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.666
- You came in last. Every time I got punished, you were underneath.
- [Laughing]

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.000
- And Amanda selected their punishment.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.166
They will be completing the
cinnamon challenge.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.875
- I love cinnamon,
but I've never tried the challenge.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:44.250
- I can already see the cinnamon
filling up Lou's screen.

00:00:44.416 --> 00:00:46.000
- I might have to back up here.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.750
- This is the final punishment.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:50.541
Amanda, would
you like to start the punishment yourself,

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:51.875
donate it to Lou?

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.166
- Ladies first,
- I think we should do it together.

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:56.375
- I'm a little scared right now.
I'mma be honest with you.

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:58.375
- That's why you wore the helmet, Lou?
- Just in case, man.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.500
- I never seen y'all so 
nervous before a challenge, bruh.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.500
- I'm actually shaking.
- This is high stakes.

00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:04.791
- All right, Lou.
- Let's do it.

00:01:04.791 --> 00:01:06.125
- To an incredible season

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:07.791
- We stink at fantasy football.

00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:13.750
- Three, two, one. Swallow.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:19.000
- [Coughing]
- He gotta go, Lou gotta go with a
bigger scoop, man.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.166
- Oh!
- Oh, here we go.

00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:21.250
- Amanda's blowing—
- Cinnamon clouds!

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.250
- It looks like Lou might've bodied it.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.750
- He got the ceylon cinnamon.
- C'mon, man, this is the real deal.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:26.500
- Real talk.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.875
- Lou, there's no way.
- Look at Amanda.

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.000
- My eyes are burning. It's spicy as hell.
- I'm sweating.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.375
- You're full of it.

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:36.000
- Look at Amanda. She's goin'
through it.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.666
- They fell apart in crisis, man.

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.916
- Lou, did you even blow any cinnamon out?

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:41.916
- I just coughed a little bit,
but we all good.

00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:44.291
- I just blew cinnamon all over this hotel.

00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:47.500
- Let's talk about our favorite moments
from this incredible season.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.250
FlemLo,

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.416
you were the least punished.

00:01:49.416 --> 00:01:51.375
But what was your favorite
punishment of it all?

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:54.291
- I'mma go with Lou with the
"Leave the Door Open" remix, man.

00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:55.625
- Come on, man!

00:01:55.625 --> 00:02:01.000
- Do you still remember any of the lyrics?
- [Singing] Y'all gon' have to get open.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.000
[Singing] Y'all gon' have to get open.

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:05.750
- Amanda, what was your favorite?

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:08.000
- It's probably the chicken wings,
because even though there were

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.375
footballs taped to my hand,
I love chicken wings.

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:11.291
- My favorite,

00:02:11.291 --> 00:02:14.625
I liked the hot dogs, but
I liked going through the eggs with FlemLo.

00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:16.416
We had a good partnership.

00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:19.375
They were doing us dirty,
and we got through that.

00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.500
- The pumpkin was the worst.
That was disgusting.

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:22.875
- Yeah, I forgot about that pumpkin.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:26.000
- Well, when you get punished like five
or six out of the eight weeks, Lou,

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.250
I guess it's tough to remember 'em all.
- To me,

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:31.666
I consider those trophies. One, two,
three, four, five.

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:33.875
- Unbelievable season with you all.

00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:37.125
Hopefully, we get to do it again
sometime soon.

00:02:37.166 --> 00:02:39.250
Signing off for one final time.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.416
I'm Jack. That's Amanda. That's Lou.

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:42.416
That's FlemLo.

00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:45.291
And this was the B/R
Gridiron Punishment League.

